{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"4019220","name":"针影裁梦","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >选择布料，排料制版，缝制衣物，再附加装饰。在《针影裁梦》这款治愈风模拟游戏中，亲自掌控制作服装的全流程。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >沉浸式感受真实制衣工艺</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不管你的版型是直裁还是斜裁，实际的排料和裁剪，才是决定服装最终呈现的关键。每块裁片采用哪种面料，全都取决于你。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.poster.avif?t=1790605593\" aria-label=\"A short video showing pattern pieces being cut out of a roll of fabric on a cutting table. The cut fabric is added to the player&#039;s inventory.\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.webm?t=1790605593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/25edb1280d57e7d270c5945a01e7305d.mp4?t=1790605593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >一台拥有无限梭芯的缝纫机</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将布料送入缝纫机，缝合成型。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.poster.avif?t=1790605593\" aria-label=\"A short video showing fabric going through a vintage sewing machine\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.webm?t=1790605593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.mp4?t=1790605593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >体验专属创意沙盒</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >用纽扣、蝴蝶结、贴花点缀衣物，还可以随心所欲地加上蕾丝花边以及其他配饰。如何装饰，全凭你自由创作。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.poster.avif?t=1790605593\" aria-label=\"A short video demonstrating white buttons being placed onto a dress\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.webm?t=1790605593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.mp4?t=1790605593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >每个场合，都有与之相衬的裙装</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小镇的全体居民想要为衣橱添置服装，既为重要场合量身定做，也要符合个人品味。你可以用手工缝制的杰作让他们眼前一亮，也可以将原创设计陈列在橱窗中，直接出售成衣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.poster.avif?t=1790605593\" aria-label=\"A short video showing a customer entering the store. She says, &amp;quot;Dressmaker! There&#039;s an evening ball at the duke&#039;s - I call him Edmund - Edmund&#039;s mansion. Glamourous? Yes. Elegant? But of course. My budget is 1000.&amp;quot;\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.webm?t=1790605593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.mp4?t=1790605593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >选购丰富多样的布料，包括棉布、亚麻、羊毛、丝绸、天鹅绒等等。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在素描本上绘制草图并上色，添加布料样品和贴花。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >排料并裁剪制版，在人体模型上预览服装效果，再将其缝合。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将制作完成的服装交付给顾客，收获声望与金币。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可以撸猫！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/5e595cd60fb58b5d312be21ba4aa03d4a0131547/header_schinese.jpg?t=1790605593","website":"https://www.freelives.net","developers":["Cozy Lives"],"publishers":["Free Lives"],"release_date":"2026 年 9 月 21 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"14.99","final":"14.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 简体中文<strong>*</strong>, 日语<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","自定义音量控制","可以仅用鼠标","无需应对快速反应事件","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["休闲","模拟"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Intel UHD 630 or Better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 2 GB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":""},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/6b964f0ee4ad9041718877ec563b0079c3353ce1/ss_6b964f0ee4ad9041718877ec563b0079c3353ce1.600x338.jpg?t=1790605593","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/6b964f0ee4ad9041718877ec563b0079c3353ce1/ss_6b964f0ee4ad9041718877ec563b0079c3353ce1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790605593"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/9324e5f5fca